#: services/storage/repository.cpp:94
msgctxt "@info - notification message"
msgid ""
"Nepomuk Semantic Desktop needs the Virtuoso RDF server to store its data. "
"Installing the Virtuoso Soprano plugin is mandatory for using Nepomuk."
msgstr ""
"Ùsłëżnotë Nepomuk Semantic brëkùją serwera Virtuoso RDF do trzëmaniô "
"pòdôwków. Abë brëkòwac Nepomuka nót je winstalowac wtëkôcza Virtuoso Soprano."

#: services/storage/repository.cpp:106
msgctxt "@info - notification message"
msgid ""
"Nepomuk Semantic Desktop needs the Virtuoso RDF server to store its data. "
"Installing the Virtuoso server and ODBC driver is mandatory for using "
"Nepomuk."
msgstr ""
"Ùsłëżnotë Nepomuk Semantic brëkùją serwera Virtuoso RDF do trzëmaniô "
"pòdôwków. Abë brëkòwac Nepomuka nót je winstalowac serwer Virtuoso ë "
"czérowniczi ODBC."

#: services/storage/repository.cpp:220
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info - notification message"
msgid ""
"Nepomuk was not able to find the configured database backend '%1'. Existing "
"data can thus not be accessed. For data security reasons Nepomuk will be "
"disabled until the situation has been resolved manually."
msgstr ""
"Nepomuk nié mòże nalezc skònfigùrowóny bazë czérowników „%1“. Przez to nié "
"mògą bëc brëkòwóné egzystejacé pòdôwczi. Przez bezpiek pòdôwków bãdze "
"Nepomuk wëłączomy - do rëmniãcô rãczno problemë."

#: services/storage/repository.cpp:254
msgctxt "@info - notification message"
msgid "Converting Nepomuk data to a new backend. This might take a while."
msgstr ""
"Pòdôwczi Nepomuka bãdą kònwertowóné do fòrmatu czérowników. To kąsk zbawi."

#: services/storage/repository.cpp:267
msgctxt "@info - notification message"
msgid ""
"Converting Nepomuk data to the new backend failed. For data security reasons "
"Nepomuk will be disabled until the situation has been resolved manually."
msgstr ""
"Kònwertowanié pòdôwków Nepomuka do nowégò czérownika nie darzëło sã. Nepomuk "
"bãdze wëłączony, pòdôwczi mòże równak zjinaczëc rãczno."

#: services/storage/repository.cpp:281
msgctxt "@info - notification message"
msgid "Successfully converted Nepomuk data to the new backend."
msgstr "Ùdałé kònwertowanié pòdôwków Nepomuka dlô nowégò czérownika."

